{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/568a753e7e4ba4b1c9d73b247c6419f6.avif?t=1758018965\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair Slayer is a turn-based roguelike deckbuilder with card-matching mechanics. Choose your path through a world full of danger and surprises. Collect powerful cards, special abilities, and rare relics. Fight enemies and epic bosses as you discover what hides behind the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World in Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things that should stand still now breathe and move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every living creature has turned against us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has lost its mind. But why?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must stop it.. now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/3d376b6146ade0af8ea1afd5c0bbcdc1.avif?t=1758018965\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your choice - where danger lurks, great rewards often await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerful Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/625490ce57819852c869681382febe17.avif?t=1758018965\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card holds a powerful, unique ability. Find, collect, buy, upgrade, or destroy them - only the right deck leads to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card-matching mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/d1db2068ab63093776e8b66304040e2c.avif?t=1758018965\" width=616 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only if you find two matching cards can\u00a0you unleash their abilities in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/4d6a00d36a664d559bd92b8244a57967.avif?t=1758018965\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful special abilities - cards that don't need to be revealed but are available to you once per level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal yourself, attack, or temporarily reveal all game cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They come in many forms and can mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rare relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/2140f8f94fc84821a381e4089fcc99a5.avif?t=1758018965\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find rare relics that provide you with permanent passive effects to support you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unexpected places, secrets, and surprises</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/297590be0473eab51fcfe08b2c061c79.avif?t=1758018965\" width=616 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disscover mysterious places, unlock enigmatic chests, or play strange games that could give you everything - or cost you everything.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930140?t=1758018965","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930140?t=1758018965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/63a486a4fdbfabfdae18c86e3a93086fc6b69674/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758018965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/63a486a4fdbfabfdae18c86e3a93086fc6b69674/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758018965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/568a753e7e4ba4b1c9d73b247c6419f6.avif?t=1758018965\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair Slayer is a turn-based roguelike deckbuilder with card-matching mechanics. Choose your path through a world full of danger and surprises. Collect powerful cards, special abilities, and rare relics. Fight enemies and epic bosses as you discover what hides behind the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World in Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things that should stand still now breathe and move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every living creature has turned against us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has lost its mind. But why?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must stop it.. now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_t