veal all game cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They come in many forms and can mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rare relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/2140f8f94fc84821a381e4089fcc99a5.avif?t=1758018965\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find rare relics that provide you with permanent passive effects to support you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unexpected places, secrets, and surprises</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/297590be0473eab51fcfe08b2c061c79.avif?t=1758018965\" width=616 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disscover mysterious places, unlock enigmatic chests, or play strange games that could give you everything - or cost you everything.</p>","developers":["aim up games - Peter Thom\u00e4"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/e28584066aae5bb41aa70de6bc53664fa7e7bdd5/header.jpg?t=1758018965","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257181473,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181473/movie480.mp4?t=1755081262","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181473/movie_max.mp4?t=1755081262"},"name":"Trailer ENG","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257181473/f68a273e8c54b7806c12e8aaff450ea9b0b7cceb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755081262","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.stea